      "writtenOn": "2020-01-08T20:56:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "as a first pass this is fine, but longer-term I\u0027d rather not be draining the vref lines to 0 every time we need to detect the vref.\n\nmy thoughts in detail here: https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/145314772#comment6",
      "revId": "ca23fca155348c3810d3841c3f4b1dbe50f44b73",
