    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b6c17888_7ddb419b",
        "filename": "board/c2d2/board.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 690,
      "author": {
        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-08T23:11:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I bumped up the ADC read time to the longest and drop this active discharge. I still had a problem when the c2d2 was sitting on my desk with nothing attached. It would float around 1.675V, which trips the 1800 Vref.\n\nThis active discharge in all of the scenarios I have seen thus far. We can keep trying to figure out a better way though (future CL)",
      "parentUuid": "d36bf98e_5db1959f",
      "revId": "ca23fca155348c3810d3841c3f4b1dbe50f44b73",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
